{"2458280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tribe Quest", "steam_appid": 2458280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Reclaim. Rebuild. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village was completely destroyed by an evil warlord, leaving your people scattered and starving. As one of the survivors, you must venture out into a hostile wilderness on dangerous <strong>Quests</strong> to hunt down the one responsible, gather vital resources, and rebuild your home from the rubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Procedural Quests &amp; The Night Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your enemy. Embark on quests into procedurally generated forests, toxic swamps, and dangerous caves to gather resources, XP and knowledge points to unlock new recipes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Fast:</strong> Move quickly to secure loot and complete your objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Night Clock:</strong> Staying too long brings darkness. Relentless hordes of undead start hunting you until you leave the area and setup a safe camp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎒 Grid-Based Inventory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires brutal choices. Space is limited, and you can only carry what fits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid Management:</strong> Every character features an individual, grid-based inventory. You must strategically organize your loot, balancing vital weapons and food against raw crafting materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Haul:</strong> Craft backpacks to increase your personal carrying capacity, or construct heavy transport carts and utilize pack animals to haul massive resource loads back from deep wilderness runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛺ Restore your Permanent Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village is your ultimate lifeline and survival base. Bring resources safely back from your quests to rebuild your home.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agriculture &amp; Livestock:</strong> Construct barns to domesticate farm animals and plant agricultural crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Kitchen:</strong> Cook meals to prevent hunger debuffs and prepare your survivors for the next deadly quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Workshop:</strong> Utilize your gathered materials to craft new gear, repair broken equipment, and upgrade your items for tougher biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/fe692a13373e6119c9ca14a9941a1d49.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/fe692a13373e6119c9ca14a9941a1d49.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/fe692a13373e6119c9ca14a9941a1d49.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡️ Tactical Stamina Combat &amp; Injury System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in the wild requires precise execution. Mindless button-mashing will get you killed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina &amp; Dodging:</strong> Every attack and dodge consumes your stamina bar. Balance your aggression and recover your stamina, or find yourself defenseless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scars &amp; Permadeath:</strong> Getting knocked out on a quest inflicts permanent injuries. Accumulate too many battle scars, and your character faces permanent death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Unique RPG Survivors &amp; Roster Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a roster of characters, each with their own genetic makeup.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive &amp; Negative Traits:</strong> Every survivor spawns with pros and cons. Choose who to risk on dangerous quests wisely. Keep them alive to level them up and unlock new traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Swapping:</strong> Take direct control or issue commands to have companions mine, forage, and guard  while you explore and fight hostile creatures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Reclaim. Rebuild. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village was completely destroyed by an evil warlord, leaving your people scattered and starving. As one of the survivors, you must venture out into a hostile wilderness on dangerous <strong>Quests</strong> to hunt down the one responsible, gather vital resources, and rebuild your home from the rubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/ee41d0926e52cc22ed2daea8e6ceb1b4.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Procedural Quests &amp; The Night Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your enemy. Embark on quests into procedurally generated forests, toxic swamps, and dangerous caves to gather resources, XP and knowledge points to unlock new recipes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Fast:</strong> Move quickly to secure loot and complete your objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Night Clock:</strong> Staying too long brings darkness. Relentless hordes of undead start hunting you until you leave the area and setup a safe camp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/e293f71cdbcf9bcf62edb528599780cd.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎒 Grid-Based Inventory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires brutal choices. Space is limited, and you can only carry what fits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid Management:</strong> Every character features an individual, grid-based inventory. You must strategically organize your loot, balancing vital weapons and food against raw crafting materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Haul:</strong> Craft backpacks to increase your personal carrying capacity, or construct heavy transport carts and utilize pack animals to haul massive resource loads back from deep wilderness runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛺ Restore your Permanent Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village is your ultimate lifeline and survival base. Bring resources safely back from your quests to rebuild your home.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>