keup.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive &amp; Negative Traits:</strong> Every survivor spawns with pros and cons. Choose who to risk on dangerous quests wisely. Keep them alive to level them up and unlock new traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Swapping:</strong> Take direct control or issue commands to have companions mine, forage, and guard  while you explore and fight hostile creatures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.poster.avif?t=1786096533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.webm?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/extras/c6098ee62537ed47360a1e718f592464.mp4?t=1786096533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fight, craft, and survive. Swap between characters in your party as you navigate procedurally generated levels and complete quests. Rebuild your home from the rubble and hunt the warlord who destroyed it.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/4f2e68b65786c47b178b3038be87930f648ab68e/header.jpg?t=1786096533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/da74dc2843d322d2e6ad9b0e0f48eb0c6a87c1a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786096533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458280/da74dc2843d322d2e6ad9b0e0f48eb0c6a87c1a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786096533", "website": "http://www.nlg.si", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</s